revise_motivation(
  new_motivation="Mindfulness, as measured by the FFMQ, reduces depressive symptoms by fostering greater awareness, acceptance, and non-judgmental observation of one's thoughts and emotions. Rather than suppressing or avoiding negative experiences, mindfulness encourages individuals to experience them with openness, which leads to greater emotional regulation and resilience. This increased capacity for acceptance reduces rumination and distress, thereby decreasing the severity or frequency of depressive symptoms."
)
